Tag
@atlaskit/tag

Props (15)
  appearance            AppearanceType | undefined
  Set whether tags are rounded.
  color                 "blue" | "gray" | "green" | "grey" | "lime" | "magenta" | "orange" | "purple" | "red" | "teal" | "y…
  The color theme to apply. This sets both the background and text color.
  elemBefore            string | number | boolean | ReactElement<any, string | JSXElementConstructor<any>> | Iterable<React…
  The component to be rendered before the tag.
  hasMargin             boolean | undefined
  When false, removes the tag's default margin. Use when parent controls spacing (e.g. Select). Defaults to `true`.
  href                  string | undefined
  URI or path. If provided, the tag will be a link.
  isRemovable           boolean | undefined
  Flag to indicate if a tag is removable.
  linkComponent         ComponentType<any> | undefined
  A link component to be used instead of our standard anchor. The styling of our link item will be applied to the link that is passed in.
  maxWidth              string | number | undefined
  Maximum width of the tag text. When exceeded, text will be truncated with ellipsis. Accepts any valid CSS max-width value (e.g., '200px', '15rem', '100%').
  onAfterRemoveAction   ((text: string) => void) | undefined
  Handler to be called after tag is removed. Called with the string 'Post Removal Hook'.
  onBeforeRemoveAction  (() => boolean) | undefined
  Handler to be called before the tag is removed. If it does not return a truthy value, the tag will not be removed.
  removeButtonLabel     string | undefined
  Text rendered as the aria-label for remove button.
  swatchBefore          boolean | TagSwatchBeforeTokenName | undefined
  Leading color swatch (12×12px), rendered before `elemBefore`. - `true`: uses `color.background.accent.<color>.subtle` for swatch color - Pass a design token (e.g. `token('color.background.accent.red.subtle')`)
  swatchBeforeLabel     string | undefined
  Accessible label for the tag's leading color swatch. Paired with `role="img"` to convey the visual meaning of the swatch (e.g. `swatchBeforeLabel="Epic"` for an epic color swatch).
  swatchBeforeRole      AriaRole | undefined
  The WAI-ARIA role applied to the tag's color swatch element. Use when the swatch conveys meaning through color alone (e.g. `role="img"`).
  text                  string | string[]
  Text to be displayed in the tag. Accepts a string or an ordered array of string chunks for migration use cases.

